{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2022-12-10 07:08:00', 'title': "ROYAL CARIBBEAN OFFICIALLY NAMES THE WORLD'S NEWEST WONDER, WONDER OF THE SEAS", 'text': "THE CELEBRATION IN PORT CANAVERAL, FLORIDA, HONORS A MOTHER\xa0 FROM PENNSYLVANIA AS THE GODMOTHER OF THE NEW SHIP \xa0 MIAMI , DEC. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- A CELEBRATION FIT FOR THE WORLD'S NEWEST WONDER LIT UP PORT CANAVERAL, FLORIDA, LAST NIGHT WHEN ROYAL CARIBBEAN INTERNATIONAL OFFICIALLY WELCOMED WONDER OF THE SEAS INTO THE FAMILY. WITH THE ULTIMATE COMBINATION OF FIRSTS AND SIGNATURE FAVORITES FOR PARENTS, KIDS AND GRANDPARENTS ALIKE, THE CRUISE LINE'S LATEST SHIP WAS NAMED BY ITS GODMOTHER AND\xa0WONDER MOM\xa0 MARIE MCCREA \xa0FROM PENNSYLVANI A."}